Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.13,0:00:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So..
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.51,0:00:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想  我们该正式一点  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess we should make it official,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.18,0:00:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  瑞秋  我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look,Rach,I..
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  罗斯来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey,Ross is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  瞧我的好朋友罗斯来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey,look,it's my good friend Ross!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.61,0:00:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  罗斯  嘿  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Hey,Ross.  Hey,Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.49,0:00:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你好 嘿  你好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Hey,you.  Hey,you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.70,0:00:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还送花呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And he brought flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.92,0:00:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks,Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我倒是那种喜欢送糖果的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm really more of a candy kind of guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.14,0:00:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你今天真诡异\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're weird today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.54,0:01:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我有事想跟你谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen,I wanted to talk to you about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.18,0:01:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我也需要跟你谈谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Actually,I kind of need to talk to you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.11,0:01:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你可以回避一下吗 不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Joey,could you give us a minute?  No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.69,0:01:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我很抱歉  我是说做不到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} What?  I'm sorry. I meant,"No."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.72,0:01:18.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  瞧瞧谁来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hey,look who's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.13,0:01:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的孙女在哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where's my granddaughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.29,0:01:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在练习变魔术\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've been practicing my magic tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他从我耳后变出一个硬币\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He pulled a quarter out of my ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.33,0:01:28.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  妈呢  她去接莉蒂阿姨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Hey,where's Mom?  She went to pick up Aunt Liddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.17,0:01:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莉蒂阿姨要来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aunt Liddy's coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们又可以得到5块零花钱啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That means we get $5 each!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.84,0:01:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我何时才可以见到艾玛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So when do I get to meet Emma
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.67,0:01:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后表演这个给她看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and show her this:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.63,0:01:40.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好耶  哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay,wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.90,0:01:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾玛在育婴室\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Emma's in the nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.30,0:01:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你要看她  我现在就带你去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll take you now if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.67,0:01:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我真的想要跟你谈谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I really want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.79,0:01:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我也要跟你谈谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. I still need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.41,0:01:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是在你们谈之前  我需要跟你谈谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But before you guys do that,I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.01,0:01:53.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有罗斯  我也要跟你谈谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Ross,I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我需要跟你谈谈 谈什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} And I need to talk to you.  About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.65,0:01:58.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看你知不知道他们是要谈什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}To see if you know what these guys are talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.27,0:02:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《老友记》  第九季 第1集   无人求婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends S09E01 The One Where No One Proposes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.22,0:02:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她真是漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Isn't she beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.82,0:02:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧她  我第一个孙子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at her,my first grandchild.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.33,0:03:00.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那本算什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.80,0:03:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本  当然也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,of course,Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.26,0:03:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我指的是我的第一个孙女\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I meant my first granddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.90,0:03:13.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有想过跟瑞秋之间的可能性吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have you thought any more about you and Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.54,0:03:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上我刚才正准备跟她谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}actually I was gonna talk to her
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果你们都涌进来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}when you guys came in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.13,0:03:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.93,0:03:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即使我们在  你也可以开口啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You could've done that with us there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.19,0:03:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  没错  当然  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Yeah,right.  Sure. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.78,0:03:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能在我们面前自摸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can touch yourself in front of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却不能在我们面前跟瑞秋谈  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} but you can't talk to Rachel. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.13,0:03:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我何时在你们面前自摸过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When have I ever touched myself in front of you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  之前你在客厅睡着时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,please. Just before,when you were asleep in the lounge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.75,0:03:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些亚美尼亚人都不看电视  反而在看你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That Armenian family was watching you instead of the TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.62,0:03:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这倒提醒了我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的游戏机还在贺斯梅先生那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That Mr. Hazmegian still has my Game Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.98,0:03:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德勒  我可以跟你谈一下吗  当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Chandler,can I talk to you for a second?  Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟  我刚做了一件很恶劣的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude,I just did something terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.53,0:03:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你放的屁吗  我以为是杰克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was you? I thought it was Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.79,0:04:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  那确实是杰克放的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No,no. That was Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.17,0:04:03.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋以为我向她求婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel thinks I asked her to marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.07,0:04:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  她为什么会那样以为呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Why does she think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.35,0:04:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为当时看着确实像那么回事儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because it kind of looked like I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.59,0:04:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再问一次  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Again,what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.50,0:04:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  我当时单膝跪在地上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay,I was down on one knee
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.66,0:04:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,手中拿着戒指...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}with the ring in my hand..
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:16.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是个男人都会偶尔那样练习一下的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}As we all are at some point during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.58,0:04:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是我的戒指  是从罗斯的夹克掉出来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It wasn't my ring. It fell out of Ross' jacket..
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.01,0:04:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我蹲下去要把它捡起来时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and when I knelt down to pick it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.58,0:04:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋以为我是在求婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel thought I was proposing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.22,0:04:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯准备了戒指  他要求婚吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross had a ring? And he was gonna propose?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.65,0:04:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想是吧  而你抢在他之前先做了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} I guess.  And you did it first?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.95,0:04:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会痛不欲生的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.99,0:04:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他有多爱向人求婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know how much he loves to propose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.17,0:04:35.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我知道  真是太糟糕了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. I know. It's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.16,0:04:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那她说了些什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,what did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.75,0:04:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说"我愿意"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She said,"Yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.71,0:04:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does Ross know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊 我该怎么告诉他呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,my God. What the hell am I gonna tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.89,0:04:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你根本什么都不用告诉他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe you don't have to tell him anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢  甚合我意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I like that. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.76,0:04:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你先去跟瑞秋解释清楚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you clear things up with Rachel,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.15,0:04:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯就永远不需要知道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross never needs to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.65,0:04:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你必须赶快行动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you have to do it now
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.46,0:04:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别等他发现  然后痛扁你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}before he hears about it and kicks your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.47,0:04:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们别扯得太远\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right,let's not get carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要个小孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.92,0:05:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  我们已经讨论过了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey,we've been over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.97,0:05:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须要先转过来才行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I need to be facing the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.13,0:05:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来嘛  来嘛  如果我们再做爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, come on, If we have sex again,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.17,0:05:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我怀孕的机率就会增加一倍\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it'll double our chances of getting pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.05,0:05:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更衣室现在似乎仍是空的  我好累\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} I think that closet's still available.  I am so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.01,0:05:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  但是说好没有前戏哦  没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Yeah,okay,but no foreplay.  Deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.08,0:05:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸  你又放屁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dad,seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.95,0:05:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该要找医生检查看看了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know,you really should see someone about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.25,0:05:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Noted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.03,0:05:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去找瑞秋谈谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wanna go talk to Rachel for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.99,0:05:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己一个人在这里没问题吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you gonna be okay alone for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.34,0:05:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.12,0:05:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以目不转睛地看着她到永远\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I could stay and look at her forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually..
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.05,0:05:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.51,0:06:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我刚订婚了 天啊  他真求婚了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} I think I just got engaged.  Oh,my God! He did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.93,0:06:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你知道他要求婚吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Did you know he was gonna ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.28,0:06:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑  就是我说服他去做的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you kidding? I'm,like,the one who talked him into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:16.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢自诩为老友团里的玩偶操纵大师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I like to think of myself as the puppet master of the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真认为这是个好主意吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you really think this is a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.67,0:06:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才刚说服了他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just talked him into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.98,0:06:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别连你也要我说服才行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't tell me I have to do you too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,操纵师也会累的  拜托  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} The puppet master gets tired,people.  Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  总觉得怪怪的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. It just doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.40,0:06:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  你们简直是天生一对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? You two are so meant to be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.07,0:06:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都这么认为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everybody thinks so.
