Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.87,0:19:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.92,0:19:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你本来要向我求婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You were gonna propose to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.19,0:19:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.72,0:19:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  这下尴尬了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,this is awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.56,0:19:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我本来是要问你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I was going to see if,you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是否愿意跟我重新开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}maybe you wanted to start dating again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.67,0:19:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但  我是说  仅此而已  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But that,I mean,that was all,Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.79,0:19:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  勇敢点吧  我都求婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude,step up. I proposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.70,0:19:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No,you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.61,0:19:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  发生太多事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right. There's a lot going on here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.28,0:19:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我之前一定是吃了什么腐坏的水果\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I think I ate some bad fruit earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.80,0:20:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  她刚醒来  而且饿了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey,she just woke up. She's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.13,0:20:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们再来试试看吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't we give this another try?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.93,0:20:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信你竟然告诉她我要求婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe you told her I was gonna propose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.47,0:20:11.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信你竟然不打算求婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe you're not gonna propose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.22,0:20:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我才不要头脑发热一时冲动呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey,I am not gonna rush into anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.24,0:20:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  老兄  我完全理解\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah,dude,I totally understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.56,0:20:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在跟一个女人有了小孩之后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Usually after I have a baby with a woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.17,0:20:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才想着要放慢脚步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I like to slow things down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.54,0:20:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  天啊   怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Oh,my God!  What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.99,0:20:25.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她在吸了  她在吸奶了  瞧啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's doing it! She's breastfeeding! Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.02,0:20:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是太美了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.56,0:20:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我等一下再回来抱她  好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} I'll come back for her later. OK
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.50,0:20:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.79,0:20:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  感觉好怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow,this feels weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.23,0:20:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  是好的那种吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What,good weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.89,0:20:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,简直爽透了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wonderful weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.23,0:20:43.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个  我也先走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what,you guys? I'm gonna go too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.27,0:20:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉  我搞出来的闹剧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I'm sorry about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.41,0:20:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  别担心  是我的错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey,don't worry,it was my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.54,0:20:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  瑞秋  我应该早点告诉你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No,Rach,I should've told you sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.34,0:20:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just that..
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.56,0:20:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  那小孩吸得真起劲儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man,that kid is going to town!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.49,0:21:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她真是完美\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.82,0:21:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们真幸运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.18,0:21:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们确实很幸运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.69,0:21:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我知道那不是求婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look,I know it's not a proposal,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.74,0:21:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道你的意思如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I don't know where you are..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.05,0:21:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是有了艾玛之后  我...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but with everything that's been going on and with Emma,I'm..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.12,0:21:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直感到...  是的  我懂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} I've been feeling..  Yeah,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.22,0:21:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也感到...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've been feeling..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.28,0:21:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Yeah?  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.11,0:21:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  那么  那...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay,well,that..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.65,0:21:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  好的  那么...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow,okay,well..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.21,0:21:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么或许我们可以再考虑在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then maybe at least we can talk about us again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.88,0:21:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  或许吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.42,0:21:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那  很好  好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,good. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.51,0:21:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想着  如果我们  如果...\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I kind of think,you know,if we,if..
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.39,0:22:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你手上戴着戒指\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're wearing the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.85,0:22:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.93,0:22:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉菲比你订婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you told Phoebe you were engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.13,0:22:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  你说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry,what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.29,0:22:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当你以为乔伊是在求婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When you thought Joey proposed..
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.29,0:22:31.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有答应吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}did you say yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.65,0:22:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们  我找了一下医生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kids,I spoke to a doctor
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.30,0:22:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿了些受孕教育手册\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and picked up these pamphlets on how to get pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.42,0:22:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  爸  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Hey,Dad.  Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.12,0:22:59.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉再次打扰你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry to bother you again,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.68,0:23:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是能不能把我的受孕手册传出来呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but could you pass my pamphlets back?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.82,0:23:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
